---
import { SmartImage } from "../../utils/SmartImage.tsx";
---

<section class="portfolio-reveal mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 pb-24 pt-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" style="--delay: 0.1s">
  <div class="grid items-center gap-8 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl border border-[#00A9BD]/30 bg-linear-to-b from-[#0a2333] via-[#071924] to-[#04111a] p-5 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,169,189,0.25)] backdrop-blur-sm md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-12">
    <div class="reveal-on-scroll order-2 md:order-1">
      <SmartImage
        src="/video-pieces/person.webp"
        alt="Design subscription workspace preview"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        className="h-auto w-full rounded-2xl object-cover drop-shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-[1.02]"
        width={1200}
        height={900}
      />
    </div>

    <div class="reveal-on-scroll order-1 space-y-4 text-left md:order-2 max-sm:text-center" data-reveal-delay="150">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
        What is a
        <span class="bg-linear-to-r from-cyan-400 via-[#00E6D7] to-[#00A9BD] bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          design subscription
        </span>
        service?
      </h2>
      <p class="max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-white/75 sm:text-base">
        A design subscription gives you ongoing access to a dedicated creative team for a simple
        monthly fee
        <br />
        Instead of hiring in-house or managing multiple freelancers, you work with one team that
        handles your design, motion, and visual content needs as they arise. You can request new
        work, revisions, or iterations at any time within your plan.
        This makes it easy to scale creative output, maintain consistency, and keep your brand
        moving without the overhead of building an internal team.
        It's a practical solution for growing brands, evolving campaigns, and fast moving teams that
        need reliable creative support on an ongoing basis.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .portfolio-reveal {
    animation: portfolioRevealUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both;
    animation-delay: var(--delay, 0s);
  }

  @keyframes portfolioRevealUp {
    0% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(28px);
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
</style>
